---
title: Booking a seat with the database lock
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Passenger
  participant C as BookingController
  participant S as BookingService
  participant A as SeatAvailabilityCalculator
  participant DB as MySQL
  P->>C: POST book (trip, fromStop, toStop, seats)
  C->>S: book(trip, from, to, seats, user)
  S->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
  S->>DB: SELECT trip FOR UPDATE (lock row)
  Note over DB: A second booking for the same trip waits here
  S->>DB: load CONFIRMED bookings of the trip
  S->>A: freeSeats(seatsOffered, bookings, from, to)
  A-->>S: min free seats over the legs
  alt enough seats on every leg
    S->>DB: INSERT booking (CONFIRMED, frozen price) + payment
    S->>DB: COMMIT (releases the lock)
    S-->>C: Booking
    C-->>P: Réservation confirmée
  else a leg is full
    S->>DB: ROLLBACK (releases the lock)
    S-->>C: NotEnoughSeatsException
    C-->>P: Place déjà réservée + alternatives
  end
